pen world <strong>teeming with secrets and lurking dangers</strong>. Chart your own path, riding your Beasts across perilous landscapes but tread carefully. One wrong step could bring you face to face with <strong>something far more dangerous than you ever imagined</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Beasts will be there to protect you from your enemies. Use your knowledge and instincts to choose the right skills at the right time and use the confrontations to dominate your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/000546b3e3009a2e31abf8fc16e9f07e.poster.avif?t=1786054664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/000546b3e3009a2e31abf8fc16e9f07e.webm?t=1786054664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/000546b3e3009a2e31abf8fc16e9f07e.mp4?t=1786054664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/0e0b73b16b60be158fb5ef35d19b8b07.apng?t=1786054664\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/0e0b73b16b60be158fb5ef35d19b8b07.poster.avif?t=1786054664\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beasts are more than just companions, they are <strong>part of an eternal cycle</strong>. As they pass away, the power they've acquired lives on, stored within mysterious orbs that can be absorbed by other Beasts. Through this <strong>endless flow of hearts and souls</strong>, the next generation grows ever stronger. <strong>Death is not the end, it is only the next step in their journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/1b475faf85a7a5033e7bda01e143059b.poster.avif?t=1786054664\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/1b475faf85a7a5033e7bda01e143059b.webm?t=1786054664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/1b475faf85a7a5033e7bda01e143059b.mp4?t=1786054664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the new demo and add Astra Bestiary to your wishlist and follow so you don't miss any updates!</p>", "short_description": "Raise Beasts from eggs into powerful Champions in this 2D monster-raising/taming RPG. Feed, train and evolve your partners to explore a perilous, non-linear world. Master fast-paced, tactical battles, uncover the secrets of a fading world and pass on the Beasts' legacy across generations.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/7073a54814c357cf42c389f812ff6455ba2f916a/header.jpg?t=1786054664", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/e915eb354dd127331045a378d7ddc3e0b7983db4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786054664", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/e915eb354dd127331045a378d7ddc3e0b7983db4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786054664", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel/AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li